            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# CodexMate 0.0.62

- Keeps weekly usage visible at the top of the menu while you scroll through tasks, with separate space for the task list.
- Fixes clipped remaining-usage text and keeps the header position and spacing consistent when scroll arrows appear.
- Adds a little more space above weekly usage and keeps the last task fully visible during keyboard navigation.
]]></description>
